<title>HUNGARY: Hungary June jobless rate 10.3pc vs 10.6pc in May.</title>
<headline>Hungary June jobless rate 10.3pc vs 10.6pc in May.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's registered unemployed rate was 10.3 percent in June, Labour Minister Peter Kiss said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;In June this year the ratio of registered unemployed is 10.3 percent,&quot; Kiss told a news conference, adding this meant 459,000 people were unemployed.</p>
<p>In May Hungary's jobless rate was 10.6 percent, Labour Ministry figures showed.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
